[Nemo Action]
Name=Delete permanently (Dukiwi Shield)
Name[fr]=Supprimer définitivement (Dukiwi Shield)
Name[de]=Endgültig löschen (Dukiwi Shield)
Name[it]=Elimina definitivamente (Dukiwi Shield)
Comment=Overwrite, then delete without the trash
Comment[fr]=Écraser puis supprimer, sans corbeille
Comment[de]=Überschreiben, dann ohne Papierkorb löschen
Comment[it]=Sovrascrivere, poi eliminare senza cestino
Exec=/opt/dukiwi-shield/dukiwi-shield-shred %F
Icon-Name=edit-delete
Selection=notnone
Extensions=any;
